# Robot Domination: "Whenever one or more creature cards are put into your graveyard from anywhere, you draw a card, lose 1
# life, and put a plan counter on this enchantment. When the third plan counter is put on this enchantment, sacrifice it and
# create three 2/2 colorless Robot Villain artifact creature tokens." Bot1's first Thought Scour mills two Ornithopters into
# Bot2's graveyard - not Bot1's: nothing. Its second mills an Ornithopter and an Island from its own library: one trigger
# (CR 603.2c) - a card, 19 life, a plan counter. On turn 3 Bot1 Lightning Bolts its own Ornithopter, a creature card going
# to its graveyard from the battlefield: the second. Its third Thought Scour mills two Ornithopters at once: the third
# trigger, the third plan counter, and the enchantment is sacrificed for three Robot Villains.

